{"id":"anormal","lemma":"anormal","pos":"adj","rank":4638,"glosses":["abnormal"],"ipa":"/a.nɔʁ.mal/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d7/Fr-anormal.ogg/Fr-anormal.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"anormale","masculinePlural":"anormaux","femininePlural":"anormales"},"formAudio":{"anormale":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-anormale.wav","anormaux":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/86/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-anormaux.wav","anormales":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-anormales.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il est anormal d'avoir le cœur du côté droit.","en":"It is abnormal to have the heart on the right side.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"heart"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"side"},{"g":"right"}]},{"text":"Ce temps chaud est anormal pour un mois de février.","en":"This warm weather is abnormal for February.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"warm, hot"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"month"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"February"}]},{"text":"Je ne veux pas avoir d'enfants. Est-ce anormal ?","en":"I don't want to have children. Is that abnormal?","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"child","l":"enfant"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"this / it"},null]},{"text":"Les capteurs ne détectent rien d'anormal.","en":"The sensors aren't detecting anything unusual.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"catcher","l":"capteur"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to detect","l":"détecter"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}